    "['ipv6 ospf [parameter1] area [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols ospf3 area 0 interface ge-1/0/0', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': '##\\nset protocols ospf3 area 0 interface ge-1/0/0\\n##\\n\\nFor Juniper, the equivalent command would enable OSPFv3 (OSPF3 in Junos) on the interface ge-1/0/0 and assign it to area 0. Note that in Juniper, you typically configure OSPFv3 under the protocols hierarchy rather than directly on the interface.', 'trans_template': 'set protocols ospf3 area 0 interface ge-1/0/0'}]]": 1,
